WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.608 --> 00:00:18.099
A demon grabbed the Monk, snarling, "Don't you dare harm our master!"

2
00:00:19.159 --> 00:00:21.741
Other demons stepped closer to Terrell, Mara, and Jack.

3
00:00:22.862 --> 00:00:24.803
Wukong lowered his bar and looked around.

4
00:00:24.823 --> 00:00:28.346
"Where are Bajie and Wujing?"

5
00:00:28.786 --> 00:00:29.246
he thought.

6
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.288
They were lying on the ground.

7
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.480
Bajie rubbed his head.

8
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.322
"Those demons beat us up!"

9
00:00:38.362 --> 00:00:41.023
Jack puffed out his chest as the demons came closer.

10
00:00:41.043 --> 00:00:43.163
"You don't scare me!"

11
00:00:45.484 --> 00:00:47.104
He did a kick and threw a punch.

12
00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:48.945
Mara gasped.

13
00:00:49.705 --> 00:00:54.606
"Jack, you can't—whoa!"

14
00:00:55.687 --> 00:01:00.108
She, Jack, and Terrell grew taller and taller, towering over the demons.

15
00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:02.489
"How is this happening?"

16
00:01:02.849 --> 00:01:03.549
Terrell cried.

17
00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:06.871
He noticed Wukong's mouth moving.

18
00:01:06.891 --> 00:01:10.232
"Is Wukong performing a spell?"

19
00:01:11.813 --> 00:01:15.314
Jack and Mara stamped their feet, trying to step on the small demons.

20
00:01:16.715 --> 00:01:18.896
The demons ran out of the way, snarling.

21
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:21.777
"We can grow big too!"

22
00:01:22.257 --> 00:01:22.998
one demon said.

23
00:01:25.379 --> 00:01:28.240
The demons quickly grew huge and grabbed the kids.

24
00:01:30.392 --> 00:01:32.433
"These kids look delicious!"

25
00:01:32.993 --> 00:01:35.854
one demon yelled as everyone returned to their normal sizes.

26
00:01:37.095 --> 00:01:38.816
Wukong took a step toward the demons.

27
00:01:39.636 --> 00:01:43.257
Roxy was still holding down the Demon of Black Rain as he struggled in the ice.

28
00:01:43.277 --> 00:01:49.340
"Grr!" the demon growled and—crack!

29
00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.321
The ice surrounding him broke.

30
00:01:52.381 --> 00:01:55.303
He swung one of his massive arms, surprising Roxy.

31
00:01:55.323 --> 00:01:58.544
"Gah!" Roxy was knocked into a tree trunk.

32
00:01:59.756 --> 00:02:00.977
Wukong spun around.

33
00:02:00.997 --> 00:02:06.400
"What—oof!" The demon quickly hit Wukong, sending him sprawling on the ground.

34
00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.743
Then he muttered a spell, and—zoomp!—the portal opened.

35
00:02:13.003 --> 00:02:13.584
"Let's go!"

36
00:02:13.964 --> 00:02:15.064
he called to his demons.

37
00:02:16.305 --> 00:02:17.946
All the demons ran through the portal.

38
00:02:17.966 --> 00:02:22.248
"They're taking my friends!"

39
00:02:22.728 --> 00:02:23.449
Roxy cried.

40
00:02:23.469 --> 00:02:25.690
"And the Tang Monk!"

41
00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:26.971
Bajie yelled.

42
00:02:26.991 --> 00:02:28.972
"Don't let them get away!"

43
00:02:29.344 --> 00:02:30.264
Wujing shouted.

44
00:02:31.825 --> 00:02:33.086
Everyone ran through the portal.

45
00:02:40.949 --> 00:02:43.210
know where we are—Birdsong Mountain!"

46
00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.130
Roxy said.

47
00:02:45.671 --> 00:02:48.892
As the demon hurried up the side of the mountain, she and Wukong chased him.

48
00:02:50.393 --> 00:02:52.814
"Help!" the Tang Monk cried.

49
00:02:54.495 --> 00:02:57.256
Demons were carrying him and Roxy's friends in a different direction.

50
00:02:59.224 --> 00:03:00.365
"Bajie, Wujing!"

51
00:03:00.665 --> 00:03:01.446
Wukong said.

52
00:03:01.466 --> 00:03:03.007
"You two save them!

53
00:03:03.268 --> 00:03:05.509
Rocket Girl and I will deal with the Demon of Black Rain!"

54
00:03:10.494 --> 00:03:12.696
Wukong and Roxy searched all over the mountain.

55
00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:16.079
Roxy frowned.

56
00:03:16.099 --> 00:03:18.060
"Where is he?"

57
00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.602
"Look out!"

58
00:03:21.023 --> 00:03:24.085
Wukong shouted as a huge boulder rolled down toward them.

59
00:03:25.126 --> 00:03:26.828
Roxy and Wukong jumped out of the way.

60
00:03:29.845 --> 00:03:33.286
The Demon of Black Rain laughed, and then wind and rain poured down.

61
00:03:34.587 --> 00:03:35.607
Roxy gritted her teeth.

62
00:03:36.468 --> 00:03:40.349
"I am tired of this dumb demon's wind and rain!"

63
00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:45.872
She started to spin, quickly picking up speed as she whirled faster and faster.

64
00:03:46.812 --> 00:03:50.114
Soon Roxy was spinning so fast, she looked like a tornado.

65
00:03:51.535 --> 00:03:53.035
Wukong's mouth dropped open.

66
00:03:53.055 --> 00:03:58.429
"Wow!" Roxy zoomed up the mountain, blowing rocks and dirt all over.

67
00:04:00.609 --> 00:04:04.050
The wind and rain blew back toward the demon, whipping across his face.

68
00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:08.592
"Ahh!" The demon fell backward and dropped the jar.

69
00:04:08.612 --> 00:04:14.573
"Yes!" Wukong leaped through the air and swung his iron bar.

70
00:04:15.934 --> 00:04:19.494
Bam! Light sparkled briefly, and the demon was gone.

71
00:04:22.455 --> 00:04:24.656
A small salamander lay where he had been.

72
00:04:26.308 --> 00:04:28.069
"Aww!" Roxy said, smiling.

73
00:04:28.089 --> 00:04:31.971
"Cute!" "It's not cute."

74
00:04:32.691 --> 00:04:34.332
Wukong raised the iron bar.

75
00:04:34.352 --> 00:04:37.273
"It's an evil spirit, and it must be destroyed."

76
00:04:38.213 --> 00:04:42.655
Just then a voice boomed, "Do not harm that salamander!"
